@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = replace-with-jwt

### Association administrator: local consistency and catalogue coverage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant/currency-validation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"country_code":"MU","base_currency":"MUR"}

### Geographical mismatch, regardless of Frankfurter coverage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tenant/currency-validation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"country_code":"MU","base_currency":"EUR"}

### Super administrator: verify before creating an association
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/superadmin/currency-validation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"country_code":"RS","base_currency":"RSD"}
